msgid "Use a BEC to provide power to the servo as shown above"
msgstr "按上图所示使用BEC为舵机供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:30 6ac6df0fbb1e42358a98df4f247afc8a
#: 8d83daefdfa143bdb8c7cf83893a00e4 d85627ee0158462394f21b9aeb01238c
#: df8f630c9aff4b54be9b7c42a598c8fd e3483e2c604c400390efdfb6f80c93da
msgid ""
"Connect the servo's TTL pin to a 5V-to-3V level shifter and then to one of "
"the autopilot's serial port's TX pins.  The diagram above shows the servo "
"connected to a Pixhawk's Serial4 port but other serial ports can also be "
"used"
msgstr ""
"将舵机的TTL引脚连接到5V转3V电平转换器，然后连接到飞控某个串行端口的TX引脚。上图显示舵机连接到Pixhawk的Serial4端口，但也可以使用其他串行端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:31 0da4b84f16bc4628b914f3dd4b4e472c
#: 202185f1497f4145b44b057edb23a9a3 417869cabf1f415d9677cf6cfe6636b7
#: b14c727ad11948d9b8b0a6ad3417b0e3 f16e8f3bcefe43dd8e651ba1f9ce390b
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (Volz) assuming Serial4 "
"is being used"
msgstr "假设使用Serial4，将 :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 设置为14（Volz）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:33 085cbff01daa43bc9a8eb383edd7e1cc
#: 0cdc8e723c7e42c1bbbeb7b467b00c0d 59296663b6b048f8868cabeeb3344a85
#: b1605e98250b4238966b03227cf4e4ae eeefb8e7b93d42b9a8b49a412335c7aa
msgid ""
"SERVOn_MIN and SERVOn_MAX corresponding to your Volz servo output channels "
"should be adjusted to specify the 1000-2000 range to obtain full output "
"range of the servo."
msgstr "应调整对应Volz舵机输出通道的SERVOn_MIN和SERVOn_MAX，将其设置为1000-2000的范围，以获得舵机的完整输出范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-servo-volz.rst:13 81e6ac020a2d4435bae5a2106c7ccdba
