msgid ""
"This wiki page is a work-in-progress and has not been verified to be "
"correct. Support for this peripheral may not be included in standard "
"firmware releases. If needed, use the `custom firmware server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ to  create a firmware that does."
msgstr ""
"本 wiki 页面尚在编写中，其正确性未经验证。标准固件版本可能不包含对此外设的支持。如有需要，请使用 `自定义固件服务器 "
